hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15834","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said: Mamar informed us, from Yahya ibn Abdullah ibn Bahir, he said: One who heard Farwah ibn Musayk al-Muradi informed me, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, there is a land near us called the land of Abyan; it is the land of our company and our provisions, and it is unhealthy, or he said, there is severe plague in it. The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Leave it, for destruction comes from nearness to disease."
